{"articleNo":"422973","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=422973&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2023년 상반기 서울런 멘토단 참여 대학생 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.01.19","hit":"5254","attachments":[{"name":"2023년 서울런 멘토단 지원서(양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=422973&attachNo=120586"},{"name":"2023년 서울런 멘토단 참여 대학생 추천 안내문.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=422973&attachNo=120588"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b><u>2023년 상반기 서울런 멘토단 참여 대학생 모집</u></b></span></p><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1. 모집기간 : 2023. 1. 25.(수) ~ 2. 8.(수)</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2. 모집인원 : 700여명(만 39세 이하 전국 대학(원)생)</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">3. 활동기간 : 2023. 3월 ~ 2024. 2월</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">4. 활동내용 : '서울런' 수강생을 대상으로 1:1 또는 1:2 학습관리 및 상담(대면/비대면)</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; - 멘토 1인당 기본 4명의 멘티 관리(최대 10명)</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 서울런 가입자 및 멘토링 신청 규모 등에 따라 멘티가 순차적으로 매칭될 수 있음</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; - 멘토-멘티 매칭 시 4개월 이상 활동 권장, 주 1회 회당 1시간(기본)</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">5. 지원자격</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; - (비대면) 전국 대학(원)생</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; - (대면) 수도권 대학(원)생&nbsp;※ 휴학생 및 대학교 1학년 학생 포함</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">6. 선발조건</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; - (필수)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">직전학기 학점&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">⁰</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(70</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">점</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">/100</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">점 만점</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">우대사항</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1) 온·오프라인 병행 활동 가능한 자</spa